---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Great Dane Galaxy | 7Sisters Farm"
  description="A short animation of Great Danes appearing on a map of the breed, year by year."
  canonical="https://7sistersgreatdanes.com/GreatDaneGalaxy"
  image="https://7sistersgreatdanes.com/img/galaxy-og.jpg"
  noindex
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'The Great Dane Galaxy', path: '/GreatDaneGalaxy' }]}
>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="post-title">
      <h1>The Great Dane Galaxy</h1>
    </div>
    <main class="content-wrapper galaxy-teaser">
      <video
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        preload="auto"
        poster="/img/galaxy-home-poster.jpg"
        src="/video/galaxy-home.mp4"
        aria-label="An animated map of the breed: dots appear year by year, the largest constellations light up in turn, and one dog's family tree is traced across the map"
      ></video>
      <p>
        Every dot is a Great Dane, placed by how closely related it is to the others and lit in the year it was born.
      </p>
      <section class="galaxy-method">
        <h2>How the groups are made</h2>
        <p>
          The groups come from the Leiden method for network clustering, which
          cuts the network where parent links are sparse between groups. We ran
          it at eight resolution settings, each with several random seeds, and
          kept the partition with the highest modularity. Modularity is nearly
          flat across neighboring settings, so the exact number of groups is not
          sharply determined. Each group is named for the kennel whose dogs fill
          the most of it while sitting mostly inside it.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .galaxy-teaser {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .galaxy-teaser video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 800 / 440;
    background: #05060a;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .galaxy-teaser > p {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .galaxy-method {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .galaxy-method h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .galaxy-method p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
